window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Being snatched off the street should be scary, right? Wrong! </p> <p>I'm an omega with a strong instinct to make the best of a bad situation. Armed with my designer handbag full of junk, and the brooding, hot alpha who's crossed over to my side, he ensures my safety by handing me over to his estranged brother's pack. I quickly learn I can trust them when they make a generous gesture.</p> <p>But I'm knot a tie between brothers, and I'll make sure this situation works in my favour. A lighthearted, fun, romantic story with a loyal omega and her pack of adoring alphas.</p>"; 
